ing with this subpoena we've  complied with everything else you have  everything you need from us  go away at this point is basically what  they're saying and dominion you know  came back with similar things we've  given you everything dominion says  anything else you ask for at this point  is ridiculous  just like by the way this entire ballot  audit is folks  i have no doubt and i have said this  plenty of times you know over on my  youtube channel at fair and balanced and  at ring of fire  if they had found anything at all  anything  a single instance of fraud  they would be coming out holding press  conference saying ladies and gentlemen  the investigation is ongoing but i want  to highlight this  this case of fraud here that we found  that had gone unnoticed this is why the  ballot alderman they haven't done that  because they have nothing to do that for  you also by the way a member of the  senate's appointed audit team the leader  of it came out and said oh we found 74  000  uh ballots  mail out ballots that we have no record  of sending out  and then reporters actually looked at  the record and immediately said actually  there is a record of all of these going  out you're straight up lying to us now  so they're openly lying  they're hiding the information  and there's no signs of this thing going  away anytime soon it's been going on for  five months  and apparently it is just going to keep  on rolling  one of our sponsors is steady md primary  care the easier and more affordable way  to do primary care and they're giving  you 50 off because you are in my  audience you just answer a few questions  steadymd will match you with a licensed  primary care physician that's tailored  to your needs you'll have a one-hour  virtual appointment and start a  meaningful relationship with your new  doctor and from then on your doctor will  be available to you by text phone and  video chat it's not some random doctor  on call  your steady md doctor has a limited  number of